g at the Hallway door so the edge lies flat.\",\"instruction_zh\":\"將走廊門口的地毯移走或固定，使邊緣平貼地面。\",\"subsidy_code\":\"null\"}","status":"completed"},{"type":"function_call","id":"fc_1596b7a6-e53b-4a20-ac8b-04a04139df05","call_id":"call_1596b7a6-e53b-4a20-ac8b-04a04139df05","name":"draft_work_order","arguments":"{\"hazard\":\"H3\",\"instruction_en\":\"Move the cable at the Hallway door off the walkway and secure it along the wall.\",\"instruction_zh\":\"將走廊門口的電線移離走道，沿牆邊固定收好。\",\"subsidy_code\":\"null\"}","status":"completed"},{"type":"function_call","id":"fc_cbc325b4-f76e-415c-9bf4-64fb64dcf2a4","call_id":"call_cbc325b4-f76e-415c-9bf4-64fb64dcf2a4","name":"draft_work_order","arguments":"{\"hazard\":\"H4\",\"instruction_en\":\"Move the second cable at the Hallway door threshold off the walkway and secure it.\",\"instruction_zh\":\"將走廊門口門檻處的另一條電線移離走道並固定收好。\",\"subsidy_code\":\"null\"}","status":"completed"},{"type":"function_call","id":"fc_32244fcc-52cc-4817-b63e-176ce2b8a9a0","call_id":"call_32244fcc-52cc-4817-b63e-176ce2b8a9a0","name":"draft_work_order","arguments":"{\"hazard\":\"H5\",\"instruction_en\":\"Move the cable in the hallway to bathroom off the walkway and secure it along the wall.\",\"instruction_zh\":\"將往浴室走道上的電線移離走道，沿牆邊固定收好。\",\"subsidy_code\":\"null\"}","status":"completed"},{"type":"function_call","id":"fc_78617ab6-f964-47b7-be7a-9868c19c8d96","call_id":"call_78617ab6-f964-47b7-be7a-9868c19c8d96","name":"draft_work_order","arguments":"{\"hazard\":\"H6\",\"instruction_en\":\"Clear the sneakers from the hallway to bathroom walkway to a shoe rack.\",\"instruction_zh\":\"將往浴室走道上的運動鞋收至鞋櫃，保持走道淨空。\",\"subsidy_code\":\"null\"}","status":"completed"},{"type":"function_call","id":"fc_da164cdb-f26e-4d74-869f-1083b151bc5b","call_id":"call_da164cdb-f26e-4d74-869f-1083b151bc5b","name":"draft_work_order","arguments":"{\"hazard\":\"H7\",\"instruction_en\":\"Clear the second pair of sneakers from the hallway to bathroom walkway to a shoe rack.\",\"instruction_zh\":\"將往浴室走道上的另一雙運動鞋收至鞋櫃，保持走道淨空。\",\"subsidy_code\":\"null\"}","status":"completed"},{"type":"function_call","id":"fc_5e03f41e-fde3-4e96-b052-f8549729823a","call_id":"call_5e03f41e-fde3-4e96-b052-f8549729823a","name":"draft_work_order","arguments":"{\"hazard\":\"H8\",\"instruction_en\":\"Clear the slippers from the hallway to bathroom walkway to a shelf.\",\"instruction_zh\":\"將往浴室走道上的拖鞋收至鞋架，保持走道淨空。\",\"subsidy_code\":\"null\"}","status":"completed"},{"type":"function_call","id":"fc_692f7b20-194c-4cbb-89ee-306146386f45","call_id":"call_692f7b20-194c-4cbb-89ee-306146386f45","name":"draft_work_order","arguments":"{\"hazard\":\"H9\",\"instruction_en\":\"Clear the second pair of slippers from the hallway to bathroom walkway to a shelf.\",\"instruction_zh\":\"將往浴室走道上的另一雙拖鞋收至鞋架，保持走道淨空。\",\"subsidy_code\":\"null\"}","status":"completed"},{"type":"function_call","id":"fc_c7537c1a-be00-4fb7-a010-105b52f8f20b","call_id":"call_c7537c1a-be00-4fb7-a010-105b52f8f20b","name":"draft_work_order","arguments":"{\"hazard\":\"H10\",\"instruction_en\":\"Apply anti-slip treatment to the Bathroom floor where water stands.\",\"instruction_zh\":\"在浴室積水處施作防滑措施。\",\"subsidy_code\":\"FA35\"}","status":"completed"},{"type":"function_call","id":"fc_0b2d015b-1cab-4da2-bcd1-1b8910501799","call_id":"call_0b2d015b-1cab-4da2-bcd1-1b8910501799","name":"draft_work_order","arguments":"{\"hazard\":\"H11\",\"instruction_en\":\"Install a fixed grab bar beside the toilet in the Bathroom.\",\"instruction_zh\":\"在浴室馬桶旁裝設固定式扶手。\",\"subsidy_code\":\"FA22\"}","status":"completed"}]